{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435179-feeding-gnosis-to-spirits","id":1435179,"title":"Feeding Gnosis to spirits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-02-11T05:44:00-08:00","id":1435179,"title":"Feeding Gnosis to spirits","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> What Spheres and at what level are needed to feed a Gnosis point to an spirit? <br /> <br /> Generate, store, and transfer the Gnosis. Either from thin air or using a Caern/Node.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-11T06:22:29-08:00","id":1435184,"title":"","content":"It depends on what do you mean by Gnosis.<br /> <br /> In Mage, I think that term exists solely as a Werewolf legacy in Spirit character sheets (as in Gnosis 8 Rage 10 Willpower 8, you know, Spirit Traits). But due to the wording, and the mentioning of Caerns, I imagine you mean the &quot;fuel&quot; trait Garou use for some Gifts and such. And as far as I know such a thing doesn't exist in Mage - well, not outside the realm of ST fiat, at least.<br /> <br /> I think it's pertinent to ask: What's the intended <i>result</i>?.<br /> <br /> If it would be to replenish or increase the Spirit's Essence, then it's the same as transfering Quintessence. I would think Prime 3/Spirit 2 should be enough to transfer it from the Mage or a Node (Prime 5/Spirit 2 to generate from thin air).<br /> <br /> Mages also gather Tass (Quint in phisical form) from Nodes, and I think it can be used to feed spirits w/o further magick (as if it was food)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 02-11-2021, 09:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-11T07:26:39-08:00","id":1435190,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the answer, yes it is the fuel stat for spirits in the Werewolf gameline.<br /> <br /> The idea is to aid a Pack that has a veey energy demanding spirit (Hummingbird totem, which asks for a Gnosis point daily).<br /> <br /> The idea is to aid them immediately, and to make a medium and long term solution, like a Gnosis gather-store-release device.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-11T09:27:33-08:00","id":1435211,"title":"","content":"Bringing Tass it's probably the best solution. If there's none at hand, Prime 3/Spirit 2 it's an easy way to channel energy from the wizard or the Caern to the spirit<br /> <br /> An artifact to store and release energy can be made at Prime 4.<br /> <br /> Creating it from thin air with Prime 5, however tempting, it's not going to be a lasting solution because it's very, very, Vulgar (I think it's one of the few things that it's Vulgar regardless of where the Effect it's casted - Always Vulgar).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-15T15:29:19-08:00","id":1435593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435179-feeding-gnosis-to-spirits?p=1435190#post1435190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the answer, yes it is the fuel stat for spirits in the Werewolf gameline.<br /> The idea is to aid a Pack that has a veey energy demanding spirit (Hummingbird totem, which asks for a Gnosis point daily).<br /> The idea is to aid them immediately, and to make a medium and long term solution, like a Gnosis gather-store-release device.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do keep in mind to make sure that what ever method you use to make this is palatable to the Garou and the totem, because they might interpret it in a wrong way.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}